OL,3,GNEWSALook North sofa takes on the Peak
OL,4,ADistrict
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC Look North red sofa has crested
OL,7,Fone of the highest points in South
OL,8,FYorkshire on the third day of the
OL,9,FChildren in Need challenge.
OL,11,FPresenter Amy Garcia and fundraiser
OL,12,FLindsey Burrow have pulled the sofa up
OL,13,FBack Tor in the Peak District.
OL,15,FOne of the most difficult stretches of
OL,16,Fthe week-long route saw them conquer
OL,17,FJenkin Road, which was a climb in the
OL,18,F2014 Tour de France, as they arrived in
OL,19,FSheffield.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
